{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04758","headline":"玄武门侍射 · 张说","name":"玄武门侍射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"射观通玄阙，兵栏辟御筵。\n雕弧月半上，画的晕重圆。\n羿后神幽赞，灵王法暗传。\n贯心精四返，饮羽妙三联。\n雪鹤来衔箭，星麟下集弦。\n一逢军宴洽，万庆武功宣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}